   "transcript_text": "person_1 (DOCTOR) 0.64-3.03s: Hello. Right, let's get started.\nperson_2 (PATIENT) 3.89-6.02s: hello, doctor, thank you\nperson_1 (DOCTOR) 6.89-8.57s: what's been bothering you?\nperson_2 (PATIENT) 10.64-15.25s: I wanted to get gritty tired eyes looked at.\nperson_1 (DOCTOR) 16.92-19.25s: And when did that start?\nperson_2 (PATIENT) 19.95-25.41s: I'd say about four days. Actually, no, closer to five days.\nperson_1 (DOCTOR) 26.37-35.61s: tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse\nperson_2 (PATIENT) 37.44-44.33s: it feels severe to me. Yes, air conditioning and screens. That makes it worse\nperson_1 (DOCTOR) 48.16-51.27s: Anything that tends to go along with it?\nperson_2 (PATIENT) 51.83-80.73s: Burning at the end of the day goes along with it, most of the time. The Burning at the end of the day? That's been since last weekend. With Burning at the end of the day, I'd say mild. It's every other day. I've had watery eyes in the wind too, for ten days",
